{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","group":"88","path":"88/88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md","title":"Uniform Oracle Parameterization","display":"lem-oracle-parameterization — Uniform Oracle Parameterization","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-lem-oracle-parameterization","aliases":["88-lem-oracle-parameterization"],"display":"lem-oracle-parameterization — Uniform Oracle Parameterization","depends_on":["[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]","[[88-df-oracle-computation]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","[[88-thm-smn]]","[[88-df-ce-indexing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-lem-oracle-parameterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-lem-oracle-parameterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-oracle-parameterization — Uniform Oracle Parameterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e,\\rho\">\\(F_e,\\rho\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b80082f9a69a6b62\" href=\"?note=b80082f9a69a6b62\" title=\"88-df-oracle-rules\">88-df-oracle-rules</a>；其一致有效枚举及满性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^A\">\\(\\varphi_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" href=\"?note=baf8d9aebf7edfa1\" title=\"88-df-oracle-computation\">88-df-oracle-computation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>；普通程序采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a> 的固定标准可接受编号，其参数固化定理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m\">\\(\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,n,v\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,x,n,v\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_m\">\\(s_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 是待构造的总可计算索引函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是待取得的通用神谕索引。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists s_m\\;\\Bigl(\ns_m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_m)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_m(e,\\vec u)}^A(x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^A(\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists s_m\\;\\Bigl(\ns_m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_m)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_m(e,\\vec u)}^A(x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^A(\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(q)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{q(x)}^A)\\leftrightarrow x\\in A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(q)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{q(x)}^A)\\leftrightarrow x\\in A\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_v^A(\\mathrm{enc}(e,x))\\simeq\\varphi_e^A(x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_v^A(\\mathrm{enc}(e,x))\\simeq\\varphi_e^A(x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>参数化证明。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,\\vec u)\">\\((e,\\vec u)\\)</span>，枚举规则图</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{e,\\vec u}=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle:\n\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x),y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{e,\\vec u}=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle:\n\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x),y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些规则的数码对所有参数一致可枚举，且仍满足相容单值和扩张闭包。对“搜索该规则数码”的普通程序应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，得到其定义域为规则数码集的索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_m(e,\\vec u)\">\\(s_m(e,\\vec u)\\)</span>。冲突筛选在合法源图上不会拒绝任何规则，因此该索引的神谕规则图恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_{e,\\vec u}\">\\(G_{e,\\vec u}\\)</span>，而不仅是某个逐神谕存在的实现。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x)\\)</span> 表示拼接成长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span> 的元组再编码。</p>\n<p>对第二式，同样一致枚举“有限条件的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 位为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 时，在任意输入上输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>”的规则，再用普通参数固化取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)\">\\(q(x)\\)</span>。它只查询一个神谕位，并且索引函数不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。对第三式，规则图</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(e,x),y\\rangle:\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(e,x),y\\rangle:\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>一致可枚举且合法；由满性取得一个索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。这些论证把所选的神谕规则编号和下游所需的统一程序构造真正连接起来，不能仅由“每个函数各有某个索引”替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-oracle-rules","status":"resolved","id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-oracle-rules]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status"