"anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]；$\\mathrm{enc}$ 见 [[88-df-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；普通程序采用 [[88-df-ce-indexing]] 的固定标准可接受编号，其参数固化定理见 [[88-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；普通程序采用 [[88-df-ce-indexing]] 的固定标准可接受编号，其参数固化定理见 [[88-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；普通程序采用 [[88-df-ce-indexing]] 的固定标准可接受编号，其参数固化定理见 [[88-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F_e,\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1},\\mathrm{Comp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e,x,n,v\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"s_m","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists s_m\\;\\Bigl(\ns_m:\\mathbb N^{m+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_{m+1}(s_m)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall\\vec u\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;\n\\varphi_{s_m(e,\\vec u)}^A(x)\\simeq\n\\varphi_e^A(\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists q\\;\\Bigl(q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(q)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{q(x)}^A)\\leftrightarrow x\\in A\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}parameterization}\\vdash\n\\exists v\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall e,x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_v^A(\\mathrm{enc}(e,x))\\simeq\\varphi_e^A(x)","display":true},{"tex":"(e,\\vec u)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{e,\\vec u}=\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle:\n\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x),y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"s_m(e,\\vec u)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{e,\\vec u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(\\vec u,x)","display":false},{"tex":"m+1","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"q(x)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\langle\\sigma,\\mathrm{enc}(e,x),y\\rangle:\ne\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F_e\\}","display":true},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":3187,"backlinks":[{"id":"07bb4f1dbc54e232","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"统一查询索引函数的存在性由 [[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]] 给出；其索引不依赖待查询的神谕。"},{"id":"4b6966788d04924e","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；有限正、负神谕条件见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；统一参数编译使用 [[88-lem-oracle-parameterization]]。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-countable-syntax.md]]\n[[88-lem-finite-injury-verification.md]]\n[[88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-enumeration.md]]\n[[88-lem-oracle-parameterization.md]]\n[[88-lem-ordinal-notation-properties.md]]"}],"outgoing":["b80082f9a69a6b62","8c35cc87b3063540","baf8d9aebf7edfa1","3b05ff7db230d81f","64279ecae5246baf","5f7e8cd4c12441fb","2e54d7c09866228f","63bffa02095213d3"]}